# Not connectivity_esp_hosted/slave/dependencies.lock (registry-only deps,
# portable). This one pins espressif/esp_hosted via a local override_path,
# and ESP-IDF's component manager always writes that as an ABSOLUTE
# filesystem path -- committing it bakes in whatever machine/container path
# last regenerated it, breaking every other checkout location (this broke
# CI while every local NAS build happened to reuse the same /project mount
# point and never caught it). Let every environment regenerate its own.
/dependencies.lock

*.swp
.vscode
.clangd
.cache
